{"value": {"url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/857", "id": 534941852, "node_id": "MDExOlB1bGxSZXF1ZXN0NTM0OTQxODUy", "html_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/857", "diff_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/857.diff", "patch_url": "https://github.com/networknt/light-4j/pull/857.patch", "issue_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/issues/857", "commits_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/857/commits", "review_comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/857/comments", "review_comment_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/pulls/comments{/number}", "comments_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/issues/857/comments", "statuses_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/networknt/light-4j/statuses/e4c6b9d7ef205e6ed1ced90e8532a9c5910cadf1", "number": 857, "state": "closed", "locked": false, "title": "Fix flaky tests in PortalRegistryTest.java and ConsulRegistryTest.java", "user": {"login": "KellyShao", "id": 24410016, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDEwMDE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24410016?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao", "html_url": "https://github.com/KellyShao", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "body": "Fixed flaky test that caused by unregistered and unavailabled `registry` in class `PortalRegistryTest.java` and `ConsulRegistryTest.java`. \r\n\r\n- **Issue 1** \r\n    - In both classes, if only run `subAndUnsubService()` method before `doRegisterAndAvailable()` or `discoverService()` method, the tests will failed. Take the `PortalRegistryTest` class for example, the error msgs are:\r\n        - `doRegisterAndAvailable()` method: \r\n            ```\r\n              java.lang.AssertionError\r\n                at com.networknt.portal.registry.PortalRegistryTest.doRegisterAndAvailable(PortalRegistryTest.java:76)\r\n            ```\r\n        - `discoverService()` method: \r\n            ```\r\n             java.lang.AssertionError\r\n               at com.networknt.portal.registry.PortalRegistryTest.a1discoverService(PortalRegistryTest.java:122)\r\n            ```\r\n    - **Root cause**: Since the `subAndUnsubService()` method is the last one, in the default test order in both `PortalRegistryTest.java` and `ConsulRegistryTest.java`. If we simply run the tests, we cannot find out the `subAndUnsubService()` method has unregistered URLs.\r\n\r\n    - **Solution**: Unregistered URLs in the `subAndUnsubService()` method\r\n\r\n\r\n- **Issue 2** \r\n    - In both classes, if only run `discoverService()` method before `doRegisterAndAvailable()` method, the tests will failed. Take the `PortalRegistryTest` class for example, the error msg is:\r\n    ```\r\n     java.lang.AssertionError\r\n        at com.networknt.portal.registry.PortalRegistryTest.doRegisterAndAvailable(PortalRegistryTest.java:76)\r\n     ```\r\n    - **Root cause**: Since the `discoverService()` method is always after the `doRegisterAndAvailable()` method, in the default test order in both `PortalRegistryTest.java` and `ConsulRegistryTest.java`. If we simply run the tests, we cannot find out the `discoverService()` method has unavailabled service.\r\n\r\n    - **Solution**: Unavailabled service in the `discoverService()` method\r\n  \r\nThe flaky tests are found by running [iDFlakies](https://github.com/idflakies/iDFlakies), after fixing the issue, there's no flaky tests in `PortalRegistryTest.java` and `ConsulRegistryTest.java`. ", "labels": [], "milestone": null, "active_lock_reason": null, "created_at": "2020-12-09T06:31:16Z", "updated_at": "2020-12-11T06:01:24Z", "closed_at": "2020-12-10T20:27:48Z", "merged_at": "2020-12-10T20:27:48Z", "merge_commit_sha": "e1e8486a09d1d75b619a1588b312c8058a501a04", "assignee": null, "assignees": [], "requested_reviewers": [], "requested_teams": [], "head": {"label": "KellyShao:registry-flaky-test", "ref": "registry-flaky-test", "repo": {"id": 319558385, "node_id": "MDEwOlJlcG9zaXRvcnkzMTk1NTgzODU=", "name": "light-4j", "full_name": "KellyShao/light-4j", "owner": {"login": "KellyShao", "id": 24410016, "node_id": "MDQ6VXNlcjI0NDEwMDE2", "avatar_url": "https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/24410016?v=4", "gravatar_id": "", "url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao", "html_url": "https://github.com/KellyShao", "followers_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/followers", "following_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/following{/other_user}", "gists_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/gists{/gist_id}", "starred_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/starred{/owner}{/repo}", "subscriptions_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/subscriptions", "organizations_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/orgs", "repos_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/repos", "events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/events{/privacy}", "received_events_url": "https://api.github.com/users/KellyShao/received_events", "type": "User", "user_view_type": "public", "site_admin": false}, "private": false, "fork": true, "archived": false, "disabled": false, "description": "A fast, lightweight and more productive microservices framework", "homepage": "", "language"